# The panic combo (DMN-07) with examples/profiles/basic.json. Back and
# start are the function keys (MAP-27): their edges are decisions with the
# reason function and send nothing. Held together for 2 s they pause the
# mapping at 2600 ms: the pan and the eyedropper held are released, and
# presses map to nothing. The pan pressed at 5000 is held through the
# resume at 6100 and does nothing until it is pressed again. A hold of
# 1.9 s does nothing. The last hold fires at 14600, after the trace ends,
# and releases the pan held then.
